pseek-v4-flash-free and opencode-go/deepseek-v4-flash remain active surface\", \"evidence\": \"index.ts:1462-1465, 7898-8171\", \"iteration\": 0 }\n  ],\n  \"ruledOutDirections\": [],\n  \"blockedStops\": [],\n  \"promotedIdeas\": [],\n  \"rejectedPatterns\": []\n}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/011-research-non-deepseek-optimization/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/findings-registry.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/011-research-non-deepseek-optimization/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/findings-registry.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/011-research-non-deepseek-optimization/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/findings-registry.json","time":{"start":1786253578740,"end":1786253578744}},"id":"prt_fe50284dd001yhlAPxhs2FnSty","sessionID":"ses_01b038435ffe8s23kM0wHD2vvA","messageID":"msg_fe50277e3001DnOmJh3ltSSozz"}}
